# Default-deny the Docker build context. Only backend packaging inputs follow.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**

# Secrets and generated/local files remain excluded after the src negation.
**/.env*
**/__pycache__/
**/.cache/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*~
